WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:03.516
"Crime stinks," Quake Man said.

2
00:00:03.517 --> 00:00:07.413
"Plus, people got hurt." He stood up.

3
00:00:07.414 --> 00:00:13.178
"I'll return everything and get a real job."

4
00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:16.025
The villain lifted a bag of dog food.

5
00:00:16.026 --> 00:00:18.765
It bumped the button on his jackhammer arm.

6
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:22.379
Brak-ak-ak! Brak-ak-ak! The arm shook.

7
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.175
The bag exploded.

8
00:00:24.176 --> 00:00:26.671
"Oof!" Quake Man fell over.

9
00:00:26.672 --> 00:00:28.853
He hit the button to turn off the arm.

10
00:00:28.854 --> 00:00:30.315
But it didn't work!

11
00:00:30.316 --> 00:00:31.520
"Oh no!"

12
00:00:31.521 --> 00:00:34.314
The jackhammer arm shook the floor.

13
00:00:34.315 --> 00:00:36.421
The warehouse started to crumble.

14
00:00:36.422 --> 00:00:40.980
Bricks smashed down and blocked the exit.

15
00:00:40.981 --> 00:00:44.045
"Quake Man is trapped!"

16
00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:46.811
*** Roxy got the last person out of the

17
00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:48.976
crack. "Thanks, Rocket Girl!" he

18
00:00:48.977 --> 00:00:52.865
said. "No problem!" Roxy shot into the air.

19
00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:55.404
"Where did Quake Man go?"

20
00:00:55.405 --> 00:00:58.021
Something rumbled in the distance.

21
00:00:58.022 --> 00:01:01.707
Using her super hearing, she heard bricks falling.

22
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:04.725
Roxy flew toward the sound.

23
00:01:04.726 --> 00:01:10.119
She gasped. "That warehouse is falling apart!"

24
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.978
Roxy flew inside.

25
00:01:12.979 --> 00:01:15.231
"Help!" Quake Man said.

26
00:01:15.232 --> 00:01:18.932
"My jackhammer arm is out of control!"

27
00:01:18.933 --> 00:01:20.774
Roxy tried to grab the arm.

28
00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:24.085
Whap! The arm knocked her back.

29
00:01:24.086 --> 00:01:27.086
"Sorry!" Quake Man said.

30
00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:32.196
"Grr!" Roxy pinned the villain to the floor.

31
00:01:32.197 --> 00:01:35.901
"Press the tab near my shoulder!" Quake Man said.

32
00:01:35.902 --> 00:01:38.370
"Then I can pull my arm out."

33
00:01:38.371 --> 00:01:40.054
Roxy pressed the tab.

34
00:01:40.055 --> 00:01:42.272
Quake Man pulled his arm out.

35
00:01:42.273 --> 00:01:49.139
Roxy smashed the jackhammer arm. Smash!

36
00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:52.840
Quake Man sighed. "Thank you."

37
00:01:52.841 --> 00:01:55.845
"You're in big trouble," Roxy said.

38
00:01:55.846 --> 00:01:57.574
Quake Man looked down.

39
00:01:57.575 --> 00:02:03.333
"I'm sorry. I wanted to impress my family. They're all villains."

40
00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:04.835
He sighed.

41
00:02:04.836 --> 00:02:07.738
"But crime is bad, and I'm not good at it.

42
00:02:07.739 --> 00:02:10.333
I'm going to return everything."

43
00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:15.322
Roxy smiled. "Good. I'll help you!"

44
00:02:15.323 --> 00:02:20.675
Roxy and Quake Man returned everything.

45
00:02:20.676 --> 00:02:25.982
They brought the mattresses to Mattress Mart.

46
00:02:25.983 --> 00:02:30.576
"These mattresses are great," Quake Man said to a customer.

47
00:02:30.577 --> 00:02:33.925
"Do you work here?" the customer asked.

48
00:02:33.926 --> 00:02:36.512
"You don't have a name tag."

49
00:02:36.513 --> 00:02:38.298
Quake Man held out his hand.

50
00:02:38.299 --> 00:02:43.909
"No, but my name is, um, Mattress Man! And

51
00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.850
this is the most comfortable kind of mattress. In

52
00:02:46.851 --> 00:02:50.473
fact, I was just lying on one today." "Okay!

53
00:02:50.474 --> 00:02:55.642
I'll buy one!" the customer said. "You're

54
00:02:55.643 --> 00:02:58.452
a great salesman," the store owner said. "Do

55
00:02:58.453 --> 00:02:59.960
you want a job?" Quake

56
00:02:59.961 --> 00:03:05.925
Man grinned. "Mattress Man would love that!" ***

57
00:03:05.926 --> 00:03:12.757
Roxy returned to school. Her class was playing basketball.

58
00:03:12.758 --> 00:03:15.282
"Guess what, Roxy," Terrell whispered.

59
00:03:15.283 --> 00:03:18.951
"Rocket Girl helped Jack get a new ice cream."

60
00:03:18.952 --> 00:03:23.780
Roxy scratched her head. "How did I do that? I wasn't even here."

61
00:03:23.781 --> 00:03:28.213
Terrell laughed. "He ate yours!"

62
00:03:28.214 --> 00:03:31.529
Roxy laughed. Then she shouted.

63
00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:36.921
"Jack! You owe me an ice cream!"

